# Demon Wall: "As long as this creature has a counter on it, it can attack as though it didn't have defender" is about this
# creature alone, for whoever controls it. Bot2's Wall gets two +1/+1 counters on turn 4 and attacks Bot1 as a 5/5 (Bot1 20
# -> 15). Bot1's Sylvan Caryatid, a defender with a +1/+1 counter from Snakeskin Veil, gets nothing from Bot2's Wall: on
# turn 5 it can't attack (the refusal) while Bot1's Ornithopter does (the control).

